---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`Privacy Policy | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Privacy Policy of The Master Encyclopedia of Dreams" />
		<style>
			body {
				font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
				background-color: var(--bg-color, #0B0618);
				color: #E2DCF5;
				margin: 0;
			}
			.hero {
				position: relative;
				text-align: center;
				padding: 6em 1em;
				background-color: var(--accent-dark, #5B21B6);
				background-image:
					radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.35) 0%, transparent 50%),
					radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.20) 0%, transparent 50%);
				width: 100vw;
				margin-left: calc(-50vw + 50%);
				margin-right: calc(-50vw + 50%);
				border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent, #A78BFA);
			}
			.hero h1 {
				font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
				font-size: 3em;
				font-weight: 500;
				margin-bottom: 0.2em;
				letter-spacing: 2px;
				color: #F5F1FE;
				text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.4);
			}

			.content-section {
				width: 75vw;
				max-width: 75vw;
				margin-top: 4em;
				margin-bottom: 4em;
				margin-left: calc(-37.5vw + 50%);
				margin-right: calc(-37.5vw + 50%);
				padding: 3em;
				background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
				backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
				-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
				border-radius: 16px;
				box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
				border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
				line-height: 1.8;
				box-sizing: border-box;
			}
			.content-section h3 {
				font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
				font-size: 1.8em;
				font-weight: 600;
				color: var(--accent, #A78BFA);
				border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.2);
				padding-bottom: 10px;
				margin-top: 1.5em;
				margin-bottom: 0.8em;
			}
			.content-section p {
				font-size: 1.1em;
				color: #E2DCF5;
				margin-bottom: 1.5em;
			}

			.content-section a {
				color: var(--accent, #A78BFA);
				text-decoration: underline;
			}
			
			.image-container {
				text-align: center;
				margin: 4em 0;
			}
			.image-container img {
				max-width: 100%;
				border-radius: 8px;
				box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main style="padding-top:0;">
			<section class="hero">
				<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
			</section>

			<section class="content-section">
				<h3>Who we are</h3>
				<p>Encyclopedia of Dreams is run by Maxora.ai. This policy explains what information is collected when you visit the site and how it is used. Questions can be sent to <a href="mailto:eugeneyu@maxora.ai">eugeneyu@maxora.ai</a> or through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
				<h3>What we do not collect</h3>
				<p>This site has no user accounts, comments, newsletter sign-ups or forms. We do not ask you for personal information, and we do not sell personal information.</p>
				<h3>Hosting and server logs</h3>
				<p>The site is hosted on Vercel. Like most web hosts, the hosting provider may automatically record technical information such as your IP address, browser type and the pages requested, for security and to keep the site running.</p>
				<h3>Google Analytics</h3>
				<p>We use Google Analytics (GA4) to understand how visitors use the site, for example which pages are read and roughly where visitors come from. Google Analytics uses cookies or similar identifiers and collects information such as pages viewed, device and browser type and approximate location. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">how Google uses data from sites that use its services</a>. You can opt out with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>
				<h3>Google Fonts</h3>
				<p>The site loads fonts from Google Fonts. When a page loads, your browser requests the font files from Google&rsquo;s servers, which means your IP address is sent to Google.</p>
				<h3>Advertising</h3>
				<p>This site may display ads served by Google AdSense. If ads are shown, Google and its partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to this and other websites. You can manage personalized advertising in <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Google Ads Settings</a> or opt out at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">aboutads.info</a>. How advertising cookies are handled will be described on this page when ads are enabled.</p>
				<h3>Cookies</h3>
				<p>Cookies come from the third-party services described above (Google Analytics and, if enabled, Google advertising). You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings; the site remains readable without them.</p>
				<h3>Emails you send us</h3>
				<p>If you email us, we receive your email address and your message. We use them only to reply and to handle corrections or inquiries, and we do not share them.</p>
				<h3>External links</h3>
				<p>Articles may link to other websites. We do not control those sites and are not responsible for their privacy practices.</p>
				<h3>Children</h3>
				<p>This site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from them.</p>
				<h3>Your rights</h3>
				<p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to ask about, correct or delete personal information held about you. For anything we hold (for example an email you sent us), write to <a href="mailto:eugeneyu@maxora.ai">eugeneyu@maxora.ai</a>.</p>
				<h3>Changes to this policy</h3>
				<p>We may update this policy as the site changes. Last updated: October 15, 2026.</p>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>